          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffd700" font-size="38" font-weight="bold">Troubleshooting Flow</text><text x="550" y="115" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888" font-size="20">"Pivot shows old numbers" — diagnose in order</text><rect x="350" y="160" width="400" height="80" fill="#ef4444" opacity="0.2" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="195" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">Pivot doesn't match source</text><text x="550" y="220" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888" font-size="15">Manager complaint — start here</text><path d="M 550 245 L 550 280" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arr8c)"/><defs><marker id="arr8c" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="12" refX="10" refY="6" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 12 6, 0 12" fill="#ffd700"/></marker></defs><rect x="200" y="290" width="700" height="80" fill="#6366f1" opacity="0.2" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><circle cx="240" cy="330" r="22" fill="#6366f1"/><text x="240" y="338" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">1</text><text x="290" y="320" fill="#fff" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Click pivot → Alt+F5 (Refresh)</text><text x="290" y="350" fill="#888" font-size="14">Most common cause: source edited but no refresh triggered</text><path d="M 550 375 L 550 410" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arr8c)"/><rect x="200" y="420" width="700" height="80" fill="#8b5cf6" opacity="0.2" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><circle cx="240" cy="460" r="22" fill="#8b5cf6"/><text x="240" y="468" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">2</text><text x="290" y="450" fill="#fff" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Ctrl+Alt+F5 — Refresh All</text><text x="290" y="480" fill="#888" font-size="14">Forces every pivot and connection to re-sync</text><path d="M 550 505 L 550 540" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arr8c)"/><rect x="200" y="550" width="700" height="80" fill="#0ea5e9" opacity="0.2" stroke="#0ea5e9" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><circle cx="240" cy="590" r="22" fill="#0ea5e9"/><text x="240" y="598" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">3</text><text x="290" y="580" fill="#fff" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Change Data Source — read the range</text><text x="290" y="610" fill="#888" font-size="14">Open dialog — is the rectangle big enough for new rows?</text><path d="M 550 635 L 550 670" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arr8c)"/><rect x="200" y="680" width="700" height="80" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.2" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><circle cx="240" cy="720" r="22" fill="#10b981"/><text x="240" y="728" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">4</text><text x="290" y="710" fill="#fff" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Repoint to a Table name (permanent fix)</text><text x="290" y="740" fill="#888" font-size="14">Replace $A$1:$F$2000 with tbl_Sales — auto-expand forever</text><path d="M 550 765 L 550 800" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arr8c)"/><rect x="200" y="810" width="700" height="80" fill="#f59e0b" opacity="0.2" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><circle cx="240" cy="850" r="22" fill="#f59e0b"/><text x="240" y="858" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">5</text><text x="290" y="840" fill="#fff" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Inspect slicers &amp; filters</text><text x="290" y="870" fill="#888" font-size="14">A stale filter from last week may hide the new rows</text><rect x="200" y="920" width="700" height="120" fill="#ffd700" opacity="0.15" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="3" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="965" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffd700" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">If still broken: the recompute trick</text><text x="550" y="995" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15">Clear ALL filters &amp; slicers → Refresh All → reapply filters one at a time</text><text x="550" y="1020" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888" font-size="14">Isolates whether the bug is in source, range, or filter state</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Five-step diagnosis — escalate from Refresh to Change Data Source."
