        explanation: "Unpivot Other Columns is the robust choice: you specify the identifier columns to KEEP (Region, Product), and Power Query unpivots everything else into Attribute and Value columns. When a new month column appears next year, it's automatically unpivoted too — no edits needed. Plain Unpivot Columns would require re-selecting the explicit list each refresh.",
