        content: `Click any visual to select it, then click **Format → Edit Interactions** on the ribbon. Filter and highlight icons appear on every other visual; click one to change how that target visual responds when this source is clicked. **Filter** removes non-matching rows; **Highlight** keeps all rows visible but dims the unselected portion; **None** ignores the click. **Drill-through** is configured on a destination page: drag a field (e.g., **Product[Name]**) to the **Drill-through** well under Visualizations. Then on any other page, right-clicking a product value shows **Drill through → [your page name]**. The destination page opens already filtered to that product. Always add a **back button** on the drill page (Insert → Buttons → Back) so the user can return to the source page with one click.`,
