      {
        type: "application",
        title: "Apply It: Audit Your Workspace Hygiene",
        content: `Go into your Power BI Service tenant and run a **workspace audit**. Step 1: list every workspace, note the **capacity type** (Free/Pro/Premium), the **owners**, and content count. Step 2: flag workspaces with **only one Admin** — bus-factor risk. Add a second Admin via security group. Step 3: scan **My Workspaces** of departed employees — orphaned production reports are a real problem; migrate them to a managed shared workspace. Step 4: rename inconsistent workspaces using a **convention** like \`{Domain}-{Stage}\` (e.g., Finance-PROD, HR-DEV). Step 5: for any high-traffic workspace, set up a **deployment pipeline** so future changes flow through DEV → TEST → PROD safely. Step 6: replace individual user role assignments with **security groups** — instantly scalable. Document the result in a workspace inventory sheet stored alongside your BI governance docs.`,
        visual: {
          type: "diagram",
          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffd700" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">6-Step Workspace Audit</text><rect x="100" y="130" width="900" height="120" rx="12" fill="#6366f1"/><text x="160" y="180" fill="#ffd700" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">1</text><text x="230" y="170" fill="#ffffff" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">Inventory all workspaces</text><text x="230" y="210" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18">capacity, owners, content count</text><rect x="100" y="270" width="900" height="120" rx="12" fill="#10b981"/><text x="160" y="320" fill="#ffd700" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">2</text><text x="230" y="310" fill="#ffffff" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">Flag single-Admin workspaces</text><text x="230" y="350" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18">add backup Admin via group</text><rect x="100" y="410" width="900" height="120" rx="12" fill="#f59e0b"/><text x="160" y="460" fill="#1a1a2e" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">3</text><text x="230" y="450" fill="#ffffff" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">Hunt orphaned My Workspaces</text><text x="230" y="490" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18">departed employees = risk</text><rect x="100" y="550" width="900" height="120" rx="12" fill="#8b5cf6"/><text x="160" y="600" fill="#ffd700" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">4</text><text x="230" y="590" fill="#ffffff" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">Standardize naming convention</text><text x="230" y="630" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18">{Domain}-{Stage}</text><rect x="100" y="690" width="900" height="120" rx="12" fill="#0ea5e9"/><text x="160" y="740" fill="#ffd700" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">5</text><text x="230" y="730" fill="#ffffff" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">Set up deployment pipelines</text><text x="230" y="770" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18">DEV → TEST → PROD</text><rect x="100" y="830" width="900" height="120" rx="12" fill="#ec4899"/><text x="160" y="880" fill="#ffd700" font-size="40" font-weight="bold">6</text><text x="230" y="870" fill="#ffffff" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">Replace users with groups</text><text x="230" y="910" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18">scale governance to thousands</text><text x="550" y="1010" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffd700" font-size="20" font-weight="bold">Document in a governance inventory sheet</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Six concrete moves to clean up tenant sprawl."
        }
      }
