      {
        type: "quiz",
        title: "Quick Check",
        question: "Your finance team built a Sales dataset. They want it to be THE source everyone uses — sorted to the top of search, marked with a special checkmark, and reviewed by the data governance team rather than just their own team. What endorsement should they request?",
        options: [
          { text: "Promoted — anyone can self-mark, ranks above unendorsed", correct: false },
          { text: "Certified — vetted by the governance team, gets the checkmark and top search rank", correct: true },
          { text: "Sensitivity = Confidential — that's what flags official content", correct: false },
          { text: "Workspace = 'Premium' — Premium workspaces auto-endorse content", correct: false }
        ],
        explanation: "**Certified** is the highest endorsement, applied by the **data governance team** (tenant-controlled allowlist), and signals organization-wide trust. Certified content gets a **checkmark icon** and ranks **first in search**. **Promoted** is a lighter signal — peer-reviewed by the author's team, and anyone with workspace privileges can self-promote. Sensitivity labels classify content; they don't endorse it. Workspace tier doesn't auto-endorse anything.",
        visual: {
          type: "diagram",
          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="80" fill="#ffd700" font-size="36" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Endorsement Levels</text><rect x="100" y="150" width="900" height="220" fill="#10b981" rx="12"/><text x="550" y="200" fill="#ffffff" font-size="28" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">✓ Certified</text><text x="550" y="240" fill="#ffffff" font-size="20" text-anchor="middle">Org-wide trust — data governance team vetted</text><text x="550" y="275" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle">Checkmark icon · top of search results</text><text x="550" y="310" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle">Tenant-admin-controlled allowlist of certifiers</text><text x="550" y="345" fill="#ffffff" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle">→ This is what the question describes</text><rect x="100" y="390" width="900" height="120" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="3" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="425" fill="#f59e0b" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">★ Promoted</text><text x="550" y="460" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17" text-anchor="middle">Peer-reviewed by author's team — quick trust signal</text><text x="550" y="490" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17" text-anchor="middle">Anyone with workspace contributor+ can self-promote</text><text x="550" y="555" fill="#888" font-size="20" text-anchor="middle">Wrong answers:</text><rect x="100" y="580" width="900" height="80" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="615" fill="#ef4444" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Sensitivity = Confidential</text><text x="550" y="640" fill="#ffffff" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle">Classifies for protection, not endorsement</text><rect x="100" y="680" width="900" height="80" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="715" fill="#ef4444" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Workspace = Premium</text><text x="550" y="740" fill="#ffffff" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle">Capacity tier, no auto-endorsement</text><rect x="100" y="780" width="900" height="280" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="820" fill="#ffd700" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">User-facing benefits of Certified</text><text x="130" y="860" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17">• Floats to top of "Recommended" content in the service</text><text x="130" y="895" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17">• Checkmark icon visible everywhere it appears</text><text x="130" y="930" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17">• Tooltip shows certifying team + contact</text><text x="130" y="965" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17">• Helps users avoid duplicate "Sales" content</text><text x="130" y="1000" fill="#10b981" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Endorsement is the antidote to "which dashboard is right?"</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Certified = governance-vetted, top of search. Promoted = peer-reviewed, lighter weight."
        }
      },
      {
        type: "application",
        title: "Your 90-Day Governance Rollout",
        content: `Don't try to govern everything in week one. Phase it:

**Days 1-30 — Foundation.** Publish a **naming convention** (\`<Function>_<Topic>_<Type>\`). Form a **governance council**. Inventory the workspaces. Identify the **top 5 candidate Certified datasets** (Sales, HR Headcount, Finance, Operations, Customer).

**Days 31-60 — Certify the gold layer.** For each candidate dataset: validate measures with business owners, apply RLS, add sensitivity labels, deploy via **deployment pipeline**, request **Certified** endorsement. Update workspace names to follow the convention.

**Days 61-90 — Sunset and enforce.** Archive workspaces idle **180+ days** (notify owners 30 days prior). Mark legacy duplicate datasets as **deprecated**. Roll out a **Purview data catalog** so users can search. Publish a **report-building guide**: "Want to build a sales report? Start from \`FIN_Sales_GoldDataset_DS\`."

**Measure success:** Drop in duplicate dataset count. Rise in % of reports built on Certified datasets. Drop in "which number is right?" tickets.`,
        visual: {
          type: "diagram",
          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="60" fill="#ffd700" font-size="34" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">90-Day Governance Rollout</text><rect x="50" y="110" width="1000" height="250" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="3" rx="10"/><text x="80" y="155" fill="#6366f1" font-size="24" font-weight="bold">Days 1-30 — Foundation</text><text x="80" y="195" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Publish naming convention (FIN_Sales_DS pattern)</text><text x="80" y="225" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Form governance council (IT + business reps + data gov)</text><text x="80" y="255" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Workspace inventory (owners, last access, content count)</text><text x="80" y="285" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Identify top 5 candidate Certified datasets</text><text x="80" y="320" fill="#10b981" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">Deliverable: governance charter + dataset shortlist</text><rect x="50" y="380" width="1000" height="250" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="3" rx="10"/><text x="80" y="425" fill="#8b5cf6" font-size="24" font-weight="bold">Days 31-60 — Certify the Gold Layer</text><text x="80" y="465" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Validate measures with business owners</text><text x="80" y="495" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Apply RLS, sensitivity labels, OLS if needed</text><text x="80" y="525" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Deploy via Dev → Test → Prod pipeline</text><text x="80" y="555" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Submit for Certified endorsement</text><text x="80" y="590" fill="#10b981" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">Deliverable: 5 Certified datasets + rename of legacy workspaces</text><rect x="50" y="650" width="1000" height="250" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="3" rx="10"/><text x="80" y="695" fill="#10b981" font-size="24" font-weight="bold">Days 61-90 — Sunset &amp; Enforce</text><text x="80" y="735" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Archive workspaces idle 180+ days (30-day owner notice)</text><text x="80" y="765" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Mark legacy duplicate datasets as deprecated</text><text x="80" y="795" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Roll out Purview data catalog for search</text><text x="80" y="825" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Publish report-builder guide pointing to Gold datasets</text><text x="80" y="860" fill="#10b981" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">Deliverable: 30% fewer workspaces, 50% fewer duplicate datasets</text><rect x="100" y="920" width="900" height="140" fill="#0f1733" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/><text x="550" y="960" fill="#ffd700" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Success metrics — track monthly</text><text x="130" y="995" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• % of new reports built on Certified datasets (target: 70%+)</text><text x="130" y="1025" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• "Which number is right?" tickets (target: down 80%)</text><text x="130" y="1050" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16">• Workspace count (target: down 30%) — abandoned ones gone</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Foundation, certify the gold, sunset the rest. Measure what improves."
        }
      }
